# Workspace-level developer overrides.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored via `.env*.local`) and uncomment
# the vars you want. Nx loads `.env` and `.env.local` from the workspace root
# for every task, so anything set here is visible to `bun nx run …` invocations.
#
# Per-app secrets live in each app's own .env.example
# (see apps/langgraph/.env.example).
